>WQ</given-names></name><name><surname>Huang</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Dehnade</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Ahmad</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Zafarullah</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Induction of matrix metalloproteinase-13 gene expression by TNF-alpha is mediated by MAP kinases, AP-1, and NF-kappaB transcription factors in articular chondrocytes</article-title><source>Exp Cell Res</source><year>2003</year><volume>288</volume><fpage>208</fpage><lpage>217</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12878172</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0014-4827(03)00180-0</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Van Bezooijen</surname><given-names>RL</given-names></name><name><surname>Wee-Pals</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Papapoulos</surname><given-names>SE</given-names></name><name><surname>Lowik</surname><given-names>CW</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Interleukin 17 synergises with tumour necrosis factor alpha to induce cartilage destruction in vitro</article-title><source>Ann Rheum Dis</source><year>2002</year><volume>61</volume><fpage>870</fpage><lpage>876</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12228154</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1136/ard.61.10.870</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Joosten</surname><given-names>LA</given-names></name><name><surname>Lubberts</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Durez</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Helsen</surname><given-names>MM</given-names></name><name><surname>Jacobs</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Goldman</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>van den Berg</surname><given-nam